Sentence 1: Vaishnava Padavali The Vaishnava Padavali () movement refers to a period in medieval Bengali literature from the 15th to 17th centuries, marked by an efflorescence of Vaishnava poetry often focusing on the Radha-Krishna legend.
Poetry, Literature
